    "Un plan qui vit avec toi": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A plan that evolves with you"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un plan que evoluciona contigo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pas un PDF figé — il s'ajuste chaque semaine selon ta forme et ton ressenti, jamais séance par séance : tu peux toujours anticiper ce qui t'attend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a fixed PDF — it adjusts every week based on your form and how you feel, never session by session: you can always see what's coming."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No es un PDF fijo: se ajusta cada semana según tu forma y cómo te sientes, nunca sesión a sesión — siempre puedes anticipar lo que viene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tes objectifs du jour, en un coup d'œil": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's goals, at a glance"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus objetivos del día, de un vistazo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ta séance, tes calories actives, tes pas — trois objectifs simples à boucler chaque jour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your session, active calories, steps — three simple goals to hit every day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu sesión, tus calorías activas, tus pasos — tres objetivos simples que cumplir cada día."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un vrai coach, disponible à tout moment": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A real coach, available anytime"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un coach de verdad, disponible en todo momento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Il connaît ton objectif, ton historique, et te répond comme un humain le ferait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It knows your goal, your history, and replies like a real person would."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conoce tu objetivo, tu historial, y te responde como lo haría una persona."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "COURS COMME\nSI TU AVAIS\nUN COACH": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RUN LIKE\nYOU HAD\nA COACH"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CORRE COMO\nSI TUVIERAS\nUN COACH"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RUNUP construit ton programme, l'ajuste chaque semaine selon ta forme, et te pousse juste ce qu'il faut — jamais plus, jamais moins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunUp builds your program, adjusts it every week based on your form, and pushes you exactly the right amount — never more, never less."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RunUp crea tu programa, lo ajusta cada semana según tu forma, y te exige justo lo necesario — nunca más, nunca menos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un programme qui progresse avec toi, semaine après semaine": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A program that grows with you, week after week"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un programa que progresa contigo, semana tras semana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
